# Article Images Path

Always store and reference article cover/hero/thumbnail images under:

`/assets/images/articles/`

## Rules

- Absolute URLs (OG, Twitter, JSON-LD): `https://salam-doctor.ir/assets/images/articles/{slug}-cover.webp`
- From `articles/*.html` (relative): `../assets/images/articles/{slug}-cover.webp`
- From site root (`articles.html`, cards): `assets/images/articles/{slug}-cover.webp`
- Never use `/images/articles/` for article media

## Example

```html
<meta property="og:image" content="https://salam-doctor.ir/assets/images/articles/laser-hair-removal-cover.webp">
<img src="../assets/images/articles/laser-hair-removal-cover.webp" alt="...">
```
